\":\"not_published\",\"note\":\"MEXC's public trades and channels carry no liquidation.\"},{\"venue\":\"htx\",\"reason\":\"window_not_covered\",\"recordedShare\":0.25},{\"venue\":\"kucoin\",\"reason\":\"not_published\",\"note\":\"KuCoin's public trades and channels carry no liquidation.\"},{\"venue\":\"bitfinex\",\"reason\":\"not_collected\"},{\"venue\":\"phemex\",\"reason\":\"not_collected\"},{\"venue\":\"woox\",\"reason\":\"not_collected\"},{\"venue\":\"binance\",\"reason\":\"not_published\",\"note\":\"Binance's public data archive has published no liquidations since 2024, so they are not counted.\"},{\"venue\":\"bingx\",\"reason\":\"not_collected\"},{\"venue\":\"whitebit\",\"reason\":\"not_collected\"},{\"venue\":\"cryptocom\",\"reason\":\"not_collected\"}],\"venuesNotFullyRecorded\":[{\"venue\":\"kraken\",\"marketsCounted\":209,\"markets\":209,\"recordedShare\":0.9867},{\"venue\":\"bitget\",\"marketsCounted\":912,\"markets\":912,\"recordedShare\":0.9869},{\"venue\":\"gate\",\"marketsCounted\":64,\"markets\":1062}],\"countUnit\":\"records\"},\"liquidationsCounting\":{\"records\":\"One record is one liquidation or one fill as the venue publishes it, not one trader.\",\"kraken\":\"Kraken publishes each fill of a liquidation order as its own record, so one liquidated position can be several records.\",\"bitget\":\"Bitget pushes at most the largest long and the largest short liquidation per market each second, so a busy second is undercounted.\",\"aster\":\"Aster pushes at most one liquidation per market per second, so a busy second is undercounted.\",\"notPublished\":\"A venue that publishes no liquidations is unavailable here, not zero.\",\"timing\":\"Liquidations that coincide with a price move show timing, not cause.\"},\"note\":\"Per venue from its latest hourly reading: open interest, 24-hour volume, open interest per dollar of volume (over the markets reporting both), 24-hour liquidations where the venue publishes them (with how many of its markets the record covers), markets read, and the base-tier taker and maker fee from the venue's own fee page (fractions of the position per side charged, with the page and the day it was read). Ranks are by each column alone; no combined score. Shares are of reported OI and volume: each venue's figure over totals, the sum across the venues that report one (reportingVenues and volumeReportingVenues of eligibleVenues; the rest are named under venuesExcluded); shareOf and volumeShareOf say OI or volume only when every eligible venue reports it for every market. availability marks a venue figure no market publishes (not_published), one some of its markets publish (partial, with the counts reported) and a reported 0 (reported_zero). The 24-hour liquidations are the stored comparable window's, as the liquidations view serves it, with count the records in it (liquidationsCounting says what a record is); liquidationsReceipt states the window, the venues counted, those counted short of some markets or seconds (availability partial) and every other venue with why.\"}}"}],"isError":false}}

